WEBVTT

00:01.420 --> 00:03.680
You seem to be making good progress.

00:03.680 --> 00:06.150
I think you're at around 30% now.

00:06.470 --> 00:08.900
Does that mean I can use my powers again?

00:08.900 --> 00:10.000
Not at all.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.320
It means that you'll die if you use 30%
of what used to be your full power.

00:14.320 --> 00:15.590
What?!

00:17.250 --> 00:18.500
Blade.

00:19.990 --> 00:21.690
Oh, what's up?

00:23.910 --> 00:25.420
This is Maria.

00:25.420 --> 00:26.940
She's my friend, and...

00:26.940 --> 00:28.380
Oh, I remember her!

00:28.650 --> 00:31.340
She was in the magic unit when we fought Cu.

00:31.720 --> 00:32.340
Oh, yes...

00:32.340 --> 00:34.720
She tripped all the time during training...

00:34.720 --> 00:38.100
and in the actual fight, I think she hurled 
a fireball in the wrong direction...

00:38.100 --> 00:39.810
Hey! Blade!

00:39.810 --> 00:42.320
What do you call people like her, again?

00:43.470 --> 00:44.480
That's right!

00:44.480 --> 00:46.170
A klutz, that was it!

00:47.070 --> 00:48.750
Ah, sorry.

00:48.750 --> 00:50.270
It's fine...

00:50.270 --> 00:52.150
It's true that I'm clumsy.

00:52.150 --> 00:56.030
Um, it seems she has a favor to ask of you.

00:56.480 --> 00:57.450
Me?

00:57.450 --> 00:59.170
Y-Yes.

00:59.170 --> 01:00.360
Blade...

01:00.360 --> 01:01.660
Can you please...

01:02.770 --> 01:04.550
kill me?

01:05.440 --> 01:07.100
Oh, no!

01:07.100 --> 01:11.080
I meant that I want you to kill me
 when I lose control of myself.

01:10.750 --> 01:16.970
<b>Episode 5</b>

01:11.080 --> 01:12.920
What do you mean by that?

01:11.750 --> 01:16.970
<b>The Demon King's
 Daughter</b>

01:12.920 --> 01:17.380
Um, the truth is... I'm not human.

01:17.380 --> 01:17.890
What?

01:18.120 --> 01:19.850
Yeah, you're a night demon, right?

01:20.150 --> 01:21.620
You can tell?

01:21.620 --> 01:22.810
Well, I had a hunch.

01:23.520 --> 01:27.120
There's something else
 that exists inside me.

01:27.120 --> 01:30.190
A magical beast with fearsome powers.

01:31.250 --> 01:35.190
Just once before, when I was 
having a very hard time...

01:36.900 --> 01:37.710
Ah!

01:37.710 --> 01:39.450
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

01:39.450 --> 01:42.120
This is what happens when 
I can't control my strength!

01:42.600 --> 01:44.130
It's okay, Maria.

01:44.130 --> 01:45.430
Take a deep breath.

01:45.430 --> 01:48.080
Until now, I was able to 
somehow keep it in check.

01:48.480 --> 01:52.040
But ever since then, I haven't 
been able to fully hold it back.

01:52.040 --> 01:54.560
You mean when we fought Cu?

01:54.560 --> 01:57.740
Touching fighting spirit, which flowed 
through your magic energy conduits,

01:57.740 --> 01:59.800
made you lose control of your powers.

01:59.800 --> 02:03.180
You mean, unless we do something, that beast 
is going to come out and wreak havoc?

02:03.600 --> 02:04.440
Yes.

02:04.440 --> 02:08.690
But I have nowhere else to go if 
I get kicked out of the academy.

02:08.690 --> 02:12.360
Maria was originally at 
Rosewood Junior School, like I was.

02:13.120 --> 02:16.860
She's worked hard for so 
long to enter this academy.

02:17.230 --> 02:19.890
My mother and father are gone.

02:19.890 --> 02:21.820
I don't have a home to go back to.

02:22.120 --> 02:25.830
That's why I need to do 
something about these powers!

02:26.380 --> 02:27.550
Sure.

02:27.550 --> 02:30.260
I know what it's like, 
since my parents are gone, too.

02:30.260 --> 02:31.200
I'll help you out.

02:31.200 --> 02:32.290
Me, too.

02:32.290 --> 02:33.920
I never knew my mother or father.

02:33.920 --> 02:35.300
I'll help you as well.

02:35.300 --> 02:36.200
Us, too!

02:36.200 --> 02:37.340
And I as well, naturally.

02:37.340 --> 02:39.830
I'm friends with Maria now!

02:39.830 --> 02:42.050
It's only natural to help out a friend!

02:42.560 --> 02:43.880
H-Hey!

02:43.880 --> 02:45.890
I want to help out, too!

02:47.360 --> 02:49.770
Thank you so much, everyone!

02:52.190 --> 02:53.380
A magic barrier?

02:53.380 --> 02:55.520
Whoa, how much power is this?!

02:55.520 --> 02:58.450
Oh, I asked Claire and Yessica to adjust it,

02:58.450 --> 03:00.290
so it should be cranked up to max power.

03:00.290 --> 03:01.360
Yay!

03:01.360 --> 03:03.190
You didn't ask for permission, did you?

03:03.190 --> 03:05.280
All right, looks like we're all set.

03:06.670 --> 03:08.880
You've been holding back 
your powers this whole time,

03:08.880 --> 03:11.600
so I thought you could try 
releasing them just this once.

03:11.600 --> 03:12.230
No!

03:12.230 --> 03:13.000
I mustn't!

03:13.000 --> 03:15.050
That's why we prepared all this.

03:15.050 --> 03:17.790
Earnest is living proof that it can work.

03:17.790 --> 03:19.010
Well, I suppose.

03:19.010 --> 03:20.790
I can't ever do that!

03:20.790 --> 03:23.290
I must not unleash these powers!

03:23.290 --> 03:26.310
I need to keep them locked up
 for the rest of my life...

03:27.890 --> 03:29.070
Maria.

03:29.070 --> 03:31.760
Why don't we try following 
Blade's suggestion?

03:31.760 --> 03:34.150
It saved me once before.

03:35.900 --> 03:38.100
It <i>is</i> kind of a stupid method, though.

03:38.100 --> 03:39.360
Don't call it stupid!

03:39.360 --> 03:41.770
What part of it isn't stupid, dummy?!

03:41.770 --> 03:43.530
Shut up, dummy!

03:46.340 --> 03:47.670
I understand.

03:47.670 --> 03:50.540
I'll put my faith in Blade 
and the rest of you.

03:51.660 --> 03:54.200
I leave it to you if the worst comes to pass.

03:54.200 --> 03:55.930
Yeah. We've got this.

03:55.930 --> 03:57.210
Okay, here I go.

04:01.300 --> 04:04.590
Each of these limits my power by half.

04:05.420 --> 04:06.510
Another one.

04:07.340 --> 04:08.390
Now it's four times the power.

04:08.390 --> 04:09.810
And another.

04:10.550 --> 04:11.430
Eight times.

04:11.950 --> 04:13.020
Sixteen times?!

04:14.530 --> 04:15.480
And finally...

04:16.030 --> 04:19.000
This is the most powerful sealing item,

04:19.000 --> 04:21.690
restricting my power to one-tenth.

04:22.630 --> 04:23.690
Which means...

04:23.690 --> 04:24.990
One hundred and sixty times.

04:25.930 --> 04:26.870
Wait, Maria!

04:26.870 --> 04:27.720
Huh?

04:32.130 --> 04:33.090
She's...

04:33.500 --> 04:34.850
She's about to come out!

04:34.850 --> 04:36.880
Oh, no! I can't hold her back!

04:37.180 --> 04:38.090
Don't hold back!

04:38.460 --> 04:40.090
We'll take care of her!

04:40.400 --> 04:42.550
Believe in your friends!

05:00.890 --> 05:02.570
Blade, that's...

05:08.190 --> 05:09.490
The Demon King...

05:17.460 --> 05:18.900
Bow before me!

05:18.900 --> 05:21.180
Fear me! Worship me!

05:21.180 --> 05:26.430
Rejoice in the birth of the Demon King 
with cries of lament and rancor!

05:26.840 --> 05:28.010
That's the Demon King?

05:28.010 --> 05:29.230
No.

05:29.230 --> 05:31.720
But the satanic crest on her forehead...

05:31.720 --> 05:34.680
Consume my flesh, Asmodeus!

05:43.650 --> 05:44.690
My lord!

05:44.690 --> 05:46.980
How dare you!

05:50.520 --> 05:51.870
Is that all?

05:57.500 --> 05:58.670
Hm?

06:01.500 --> 06:05.630
Artificial Great Hero Power:
 Ultimate Gravity.

06:08.520 --> 06:11.320
Oh, I can't move after that.

06:11.320 --> 06:13.060
I leave the rest to you...

06:13.500 --> 06:15.970
Well, then, are you ready?

06:24.140 --> 06:25.150
So hot.

06:28.640 --> 06:29.570
Here.

06:29.570 --> 06:30.660
You can have it back.

06:42.670 --> 06:44.610
Are you the last one left?

06:44.610 --> 06:45.360
Okay.

06:45.360 --> 06:48.800
Once I'm out of here,
I'll lay waste to the royal capital.

06:53.470 --> 06:55.220
What's the meaning of this?

06:55.550 --> 06:58.530
Don't tell me you're trying 
to take the Demon King alive?

06:58.530 --> 06:59.580
Found me out?

07:01.640 --> 07:03.190
You're a funny one.

07:03.600 --> 07:05.040
Fight me seriously.

07:05.040 --> 07:06.320
Or I'll kill you.

07:08.620 --> 07:10.680
I'm here to kill you.

07:10.680 --> 07:13.990
If you don't intend to kill me,
I'll make sure you die.

07:15.180 --> 07:16.940
Don't give out on me, body!

07:17.950 --> 07:18.910
Hm?

07:25.000 --> 07:26.540
Is that all you've got?

07:26.540 --> 07:28.710
If so, now it's my turn.

07:28.990 --> 07:30.920
Don't die in one shot now.

07:30.920 --> 07:32.090
Hey, wait!

07:32.090 --> 07:33.090
Sun Ray.

07:44.140 --> 07:45.940
Oh? You're still alive?

07:47.090 --> 07:47.900
Blade.

07:48.150 --> 07:50.110
Earnest! Don't push yourself!

07:50.760 --> 07:53.070
Take this...

07:58.780 --> 08:00.290
Asmodeus.

08:00.290 --> 08:02.250
This goes very much against my will,

08:02.250 --> 08:04.080
but it is what my master desires.

08:04.080 --> 08:06.540
I shall consider this a limited contract.

08:06.540 --> 08:09.310
Oh? Now that's a fine weapon.

08:09.310 --> 08:12.170
It looks like I can expect 
a somewhat amusing fight.

08:12.170 --> 08:15.270
Sorry. I don't fight to amuse anyone.

08:16.090 --> 08:18.180
I'll be ending this with one blow.

08:18.180 --> 08:20.970
You think you can take down 
the Demon King in one blow?

08:20.970 --> 08:22.040
Interesting!

08:22.040 --> 08:23.020
Show me, then!

08:31.080 --> 08:32.160
S-Stop that!

08:32.160 --> 08:34.860
I'm not sure if even I can 
fully handle such power!

08:34.860 --> 08:36.790
Quit your grumbling.

08:36.790 --> 08:39.790
You're Earnest's sword,
so bear it with sheer willpower.

08:39.790 --> 08:40.370
Here I go!

08:40.960 --> 08:42.000
Holy Demon Blade!

08:42.730 --> 08:43.790
Come forth!

08:50.550 --> 08:52.340
Pretty impressive.

08:56.360 --> 08:57.890
Th-This can't be!

08:58.630 --> 09:00.660
I'm being overpowered?!

09:00.660 --> 09:01.790
You!

09:01.790 --> 09:03.930
What the hell <i>are</i> you?!

09:04.400 --> 09:06.380
Just your ordinary fellow.

09:06.380 --> 09:07.560
At least, I am now!

09:29.940 --> 09:33.670
I'm just glad no one ended up dying...

09:34.750 --> 09:35.420
Huh?

09:45.080 --> 09:46.310
I'm...

09:50.730 --> 09:53.190
You idiot!

09:53.190 --> 09:54.860
You big, fat idiot!

09:54.860 --> 09:57.070
You don't have to be so reckless anymore!

09:57.070 --> 09:59.460
Why do you always make me worry so much?!

09:59.460 --> 10:00.490
Um...

10:00.490 --> 10:02.950
You were dead, you know!

10:03.830 --> 10:07.500
If I hadn't gotten to you in time, 
you would have been a goner!

10:07.500 --> 10:10.490
Last time, you promised you 
wouldn't make me cry again!

10:10.490 --> 10:11.460
You liar!

10:14.770 --> 10:15.850
Sorry.

10:15.850 --> 10:17.390
I'll be careful from now on.

10:18.610 --> 10:19.260
And the others?

10:19.710 --> 10:20.960
They'll be fine.

10:20.960 --> 10:23.010
Claire is treating them as we speak.

10:23.010 --> 10:24.390
I see.

10:25.710 --> 10:26.980
And what about her?

10:27.930 --> 10:29.010
She's alive.

10:31.680 --> 10:34.980
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

10:32.740 --> 10:34.980
Pretty impressive.

10:35.830 --> 10:36.610
Good morning!

10:36.710 --> 10:37.440
Good morning!

10:37.680 --> 10:38.660
Good morning!

10:38.660 --> 10:39.910
G-Good morning!

10:41.730 --> 10:42.870
Good morning.

10:43.750 --> 10:44.870
Hey, good morning.

10:44.870 --> 10:46.300
Good morning, Great Hero—

10:48.320 --> 10:50.210
So I was right.

10:50.210 --> 10:53.040
Now I have something to use against you.

10:53.040 --> 10:55.050
Stop it, Maria. Seriously.

10:55.300 --> 10:58.320
Maria is a different personality.

10:58.320 --> 10:59.580
Then who are you?

10:59.580 --> 11:02.290
I don't... have a name.

11:03.040 --> 11:05.510
No one's ever given me one.

11:05.960 --> 11:06.990
De-mao!

11:06.990 --> 11:08.720
Good morning, De-mao!

11:08.720 --> 11:09.600
Good morning.

11:10.690 --> 11:12.060
De-mao?

11:12.960 --> 11:14.020
It's true.

11:14.480 --> 11:17.730
I am the one who welcomed 
Maria into this school.

11:18.220 --> 11:20.220
I'm aware of her identity.

11:21.730 --> 11:24.140
Maria's mother was human.

11:24.140 --> 11:27.200
Unfortunately, she's passed away.

11:27.200 --> 11:28.330
And her father?

11:28.540 --> 11:30.350
His fate is unknown.

11:30.350 --> 11:33.290
However, we know who he is.

11:35.500 --> 11:38.800
Her father was once known
as the Demon King.

11:39.710 --> 11:44.220
In other words, she's the 
Demon King's daughter.

11:51.500 --> 11:53.730
She really has gotten used to life here.

11:53.730 --> 11:56.030
But she's dangerous, right?

11:56.030 --> 11:57.770
Is it okay to leave her alone like this?

11:57.770 --> 11:59.340
Well...

11:59.340 --> 12:01.860
His Majesty decided to let her go free,

12:01.860 --> 12:05.800
saying, "I'll take full responsibility!"

12:07.130 --> 12:10.500
Right now, with my powers curbed, 
I'm just an ordinary young girl.

12:10.920 --> 12:13.330
If you tell me to attend school, I'll do so,

12:13.650 --> 12:16.540
and if you tell me to wear this 
frilly garb, I will oblige.

12:16.540 --> 12:20.930
You say that, but don't you really 
just want to wear cute clothes?

12:20.930 --> 12:21.910
Stop that, Yessica!

12:21.910 --> 12:23.050
Don't make her angry!

12:23.420 --> 12:24.560
Hm.

12:24.560 --> 12:27.510
If I'm honest, it <i>does</i> set my heart aflutter.

12:28.040 --> 12:30.520
This frilly garb is quite something.

12:36.430 --> 12:37.430
Mao!

12:37.430 --> 12:39.940
Let those girls go back to 
their classrooms already!

12:40.200 --> 12:42.400
I didn't ask them to come here.

12:42.700 --> 12:44.770
Hey, why are you calling her Mao?

12:44.770 --> 12:47.010
Think of it like a nickname.

12:47.010 --> 12:50.120
Everyone calls her De-mao, 
but Mao is shorter.

12:50.120 --> 12:51.240
I see.

12:51.240 --> 12:54.060
Yes. I am almighty, and generous as well.

12:54.060 --> 12:56.530
I will allow this young girl to call me Mao.

12:56.530 --> 12:58.760
Dragons are the almighty ones!

12:58.760 --> 13:00.130
What'd you say, whelp?

13:00.130 --> 13:01.780
Do you want a rematch?

13:02.490 --> 13:04.120
Parent!

13:06.460 --> 13:07.580
That's enough.

13:07.580 --> 13:08.890
Break time is over.

13:08.890 --> 13:11.760
Great— I mean, Blade.

13:11.760 --> 13:14.770
I'd happily welcome a 
rematch with you any day.

13:15.460 --> 13:17.230
Now then, let us be off.

13:19.690 --> 13:20.740
Um...

13:20.740 --> 13:23.280
Mao and Maria are distinct 
personalities, right?

13:23.550 --> 13:24.300
Yes.

13:24.790 --> 13:28.300
Then how come Maria hasn't 
shown herself ever since then?

13:28.300 --> 13:29.490
That's a good point.

13:30.020 --> 13:31.950
I'm scared.

13:31.950 --> 13:34.960
Scared that I'll never be 
able to see Maria again.

13:48.650 --> 13:51.100
Good morning, Great Hero Blade.

13:51.580 --> 13:52.820
That's not right!

13:52.820 --> 13:54.090
I see.

13:54.090 --> 13:56.080
I suppose I should say, "Good evening."

13:56.080 --> 13:58.060
Well, what do you want?

13:58.060 --> 14:01.050
Yes. I'm here to invite you.

14:01.050 --> 14:03.300
I heard about it from a fellow classmate.

14:03.300 --> 14:05.320
She called it a da...

14:05.320 --> 14:06.570
Yes, a date!

14:06.570 --> 14:07.980
Huh?

14:07.980 --> 14:08.720
Listen up!

14:08.720 --> 14:11.100
A date begins at 1000 hours...

14:11.100 --> 14:12.280
H-Hey!

14:13.610 --> 14:14.780
Look, Great Hero.

14:14.780 --> 14:16.500
The moons are beautiful tonight.

14:16.730 --> 14:19.310
Seriously, stop calling me that!

14:19.310 --> 14:21.710
Besides, the moons are always out at night!

14:22.160 --> 14:25.460
Maria spent all her time 
staring at the ground.

14:27.860 --> 14:30.780
Oh, yeah. How old are you, anyway?

14:30.780 --> 14:33.180
You don't seem to know a whole lot.

14:33.180 --> 14:37.680
I began to gain self-awareness 
around five years ago.

14:38.040 --> 14:39.550
Huh? You're five years old?

14:39.550 --> 14:42.150
Age is no matter to a magical beast.

14:42.640 --> 14:46.720
As a lady, however, I don't appreciate 
being treated as a child.

14:46.720 --> 14:48.110
You're a lady now?

14:49.590 --> 14:51.570
Can't you see for yourself?

14:54.320 --> 14:57.810
And here I am, so attached to you.

14:57.810 --> 14:58.810
Is that right?

14:58.810 --> 15:03.420
The reason I've stayed at this school 
is because of you, Great Hero.

15:03.420 --> 15:06.880
You looked like you were enjoying 
life here at the academy.

15:06.880 --> 15:09.040
Yes, there's that, too.

15:09.040 --> 15:11.150
I do enjoy that frilly garb.

15:11.150 --> 15:14.800
However, a magical beast 
seeks out strength by nature.

15:14.800 --> 15:16.850
Everything else can be 
discarded when it sees fit.

15:17.120 --> 15:21.960
And yet, I'm attached to you, 
for reasons I don't fully understand.

15:21.960 --> 15:26.860
Even though you've grown weaker 
since our previous fight.

15:26.860 --> 15:30.650
I was told that I'll die if I use
 15% of my power next time.

15:31.120 --> 15:34.320
As you are, you're not a 
foe worth even killing.

15:34.320 --> 15:37.440
But I've made up my mind.

15:37.440 --> 15:40.210
I won't leave this place 
until I've killed you.

15:40.710 --> 15:42.710
Man, that's brutal.

15:43.380 --> 15:46.870
It's not good to be unaware 
of your own feelings.

15:46.870 --> 15:50.630
I've thought about it,
and came up with a hypothesis.

15:51.700 --> 15:53.090
That is...

15:53.700 --> 15:58.010
Perhaps I've become attracted to you.

16:00.090 --> 16:01.020
What?!

16:01.020 --> 16:02.990
It's just a hypothesis,

16:02.990 --> 16:05.020
which is why I want to test it out.

16:08.160 --> 16:10.350
Won't you be my mate?

16:10.940 --> 16:15.070
I don't really know what that'd involve...

16:15.070 --> 16:17.040
Neither do I.

16:17.040 --> 16:18.480
You <i>do</i> realize I'm five.

16:18.480 --> 16:20.950
Wouldn't it be easier to
 head over to a testing ground,

16:20.950 --> 16:24.600
and fight until we're both satisfied?

16:24.600 --> 16:27.440
You're in no shape to fight.

16:27.440 --> 16:32.250
What's more, I can't take 
this off of my own volition.

16:32.250 --> 16:35.440
Maria's consciousness
 within me resists it.

16:36.140 --> 16:38.430
She's so weak, yet she defies me...

16:40.110 --> 16:43.190
At the very least, I suppose she 
<i>did</i> bring me into this world.

16:43.190 --> 16:45.320
What happened to Maria?

16:45.320 --> 16:47.710
Are Claire and the others worried?

16:47.710 --> 16:50.900
She's hiding away in the 
deepest recesses of the mind.

16:53.120 --> 16:58.120
Despite appearances, there are dark 
shadows stewing within Maria's heart.

16:58.540 --> 17:01.330
She was scorned and feared by humans...

17:02.030 --> 17:07.290
She rued her misfortune, forced to 
live in hiding with only our mother.

17:08.130 --> 17:10.620
Our mother believed in our father.

17:10.620 --> 17:14.260
However, Maria could not have faith in him.

17:15.040 --> 17:19.720
Eventually, our mother died,
 and Maria's mind was flooded with doubt.

17:20.370 --> 17:23.650
Could it be that our father 
had not loved our mother?

17:23.650 --> 17:26.190
Why had he abandoned the human realm?

17:26.900 --> 17:30.670
Could it be that our father was 
the cause of all of her suffering?

17:31.980 --> 17:37.560
I was born in order to escape 
that unbearable pain in her mind.

17:38.080 --> 17:39.740
I see...

17:39.740 --> 17:43.250
So perhaps Maria might never return.

17:43.250 --> 17:45.020
It would be easier that way.

17:46.410 --> 17:50.850
I've told you all this because you're 
closer to our kind than to humanity.

17:50.850 --> 17:52.840
One more thing I like about you.

17:53.920 --> 17:56.050
That's all in the past now.

17:56.050 --> 17:58.510
<b>A few days later</b>

17:58.820 --> 18:03.720
From my research, I just can't see how 
that pendant could be a sealing item!

18:04.000 --> 18:04.910
What?

18:04.910 --> 18:06.410
Um... who is this?

18:06.410 --> 18:07.640
She's Maria's friend...

18:07.640 --> 18:08.980
Eliza!

18:09.280 --> 18:11.900
Are you sure it's not a sealing item?

18:11.900 --> 18:13.830
I'm absolutely certain!

18:13.830 --> 18:17.620
If I'm wrong, I swear to disembowel myself!

18:17.620 --> 18:19.360
You don't have to go that far!

18:19.930 --> 18:24.330
You say that, but I'm definitely 
being restricted by this item.

18:24.820 --> 18:26.290
What kind of item is it?

18:26.520 --> 18:27.500
Right.

18:27.500 --> 18:30.320
I haven't been able to fully analyze it,

18:30.320 --> 18:32.750
but I believe that it's some 
sort of recording device.

18:33.040 --> 18:34.300
Recording?

18:34.300 --> 18:36.460
You could consider it a type of message cube.

18:36.790 --> 18:38.590
This is just conjecture,

18:38.590 --> 18:41.920
but it may contain a message from 
the person who gave you that pendant.

18:41.920 --> 18:45.430
Going by Maria's memories,
this was a keepsake from our mother.

18:46.710 --> 18:48.220
Let me warn you beforehand.

18:48.720 --> 18:53.520
I believe that recording could 
serve to bring Maria back.

18:53.520 --> 18:55.230
That would mean...

18:55.230 --> 18:56.430
I see.

18:56.430 --> 18:59.450
It could end up destroying me,
the Demon King.

19:00.860 --> 19:02.030
How fascinating.

19:03.940 --> 19:05.990
Would we be okay if we play it?

19:09.250 --> 19:10.920
Yes, go ahead.

19:12.590 --> 19:14.040
In that case, let us begin.

19:19.240 --> 19:22.460
Perhaps we could have become friends, too.

19:22.940 --> 19:24.930
If it didn't mean losing Maria...

19:24.930 --> 19:26.390
Rest assured.

19:26.390 --> 19:29.770
It seems that one of us 
is destined to disappear.

19:29.770 --> 19:32.900
I'm sure whoever remains will 
be friends with you all.

19:33.750 --> 19:35.280
I'm ready now.

19:35.760 --> 19:37.360
Please open the pendant.

19:37.910 --> 19:38.810
Yes.

19:53.450 --> 19:54.520
The Demon King.

19:55.680 --> 19:57.460
So this is the Demon King?

19:57.460 --> 20:00.170
Huh, he's pretty hot!

20:04.560 --> 20:06.470
<i>My beloved Emilia.</i>

20:06.760 --> 20:07.970
Emilia?

20:07.970 --> 20:09.200
Our mother's name.

20:09.200 --> 20:13.080
<i>Find it in your heart to forgive 
me for leaving you behind...</i>

20:13.080 --> 20:15.000
<i>No, resent me.</i>

20:15.440 --> 20:18.070
<i>There is a foe whom I must face in combat.</i>

20:19.160 --> 20:23.510
<i>I do not wish to take you 
down this bloodied path.</i>

20:23.510 --> 20:25.790
<i>You may think it self-serving of me...</i>

20:25.790 --> 20:27.510
<i>but there is a reason I cannot.</i>

20:28.400 --> 20:31.620
<i>You may not have realized it yet,</i>

20:31.620 --> 20:35.330
<i>but your body houses a brand-new life.</i>

20:35.330 --> 20:39.350
<i>To think that I, a magical beast, 
could sire a child with a human.</i>

20:39.840 --> 20:43.330
<i>Be it a boy or a girl, 
I've chosen names.</i>

20:43.330 --> 20:45.340
<i>Ortous if it is male.</i>

20:45.340 --> 20:47.630
<i>If it is female, Maria.</i>

20:48.270 --> 20:52.620
<i>Once that child can understand language,
 tell them this:</i>

20:52.620 --> 20:54.020
<i>Their father is dead.</i>

21:00.640 --> 21:03.900
How long are you going to hide in here for?

21:04.400 --> 21:07.450
It's no fun beating someone 
as useless as you.

21:08.460 --> 21:10.300
I'm...

21:14.090 --> 21:17.370
<i>Emilia. My child yet unseen.</i>

21:17.370 --> 21:22.590
<i>I swear upon my satanic crest that 
I will continue loving you both.</i>

21:25.830 --> 21:29.840
<i>Forevermore, though my body may perish.</i>

21:31.360 --> 21:33.200
Mao, you're...

21:33.680 --> 21:34.450
Yes.

21:34.980 --> 21:37.600
I can barely control my body now.

21:38.310 --> 21:41.990
It seems that the strength of our wills
 plays a role in this battle, too.

21:42.480 --> 21:46.570
As we speak, the two of us are fighting 
to see which one gets to survive.

21:51.390 --> 21:54.500
It looks like I'm about to 
be annihilated by Maria.

21:54.500 --> 21:56.000
H-Hey...

21:56.000 --> 21:57.280
It's almost time.

21:58.480 --> 22:00.670
Go on, call her name.

22:05.020 --> 22:06.340
I don't mind.

22:09.360 --> 22:10.350
Maria!

22:41.580 --> 22:43.040
Blade!

22:43.040 --> 22:44.220
Don't you lose to her!

22:44.220 --> 22:45.710
Maria! You can do it!

22:45.710 --> 22:48.490
Maria! Show us the usual!

22:48.490 --> 22:50.380
Um... do you mind?

22:50.380 --> 22:51.410
It's fine.

22:51.410 --> 22:52.180
Okay...

22:57.310 --> 22:58.620
Come, Blade!

22:58.620 --> 23:00.270
Your life ends here!

23:01.240 --> 23:02.190
Let's go!

23:08.820 --> 23:11.490
Mao didn't disappear, which means...

23:11.490 --> 23:14.530
It must be because Maria 
wants to coexist with her.

23:15.030 --> 23:17.500
This is the future she wanted.

23:18.880 --> 23:20.040
Surrender already!

23:20.040 --> 23:23.130
The Demon King would never...

23:23.600 --> 23:24.660
Mao!

23:24.660 --> 23:27.090
Show Blade who's boss!

23:34.300 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.050 --> 23:40.020
<b>The General and the Sacred Bird</b>
